  "n1": {
   "x": 5620,
   "y": 8040,
   "w": 360,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "teal",
   "text": "Prototype: tap a preset chip, type in any field, open the accordions. Results recalculate live with the spec's exact paisa engine. 'Save as my loan' opens S5 prefilled; the tab bar links S3, S4 and S8."
  },
  "n2": {
   "x": 6110,
   "y": 12770,
   "w": 360,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "purple",
   "text": "Flows: S4 card → S7. '+' → S5 → Save → success moment → S7. S7 ⋯ → Edit (S5) or Delete → confirm → S4 with Undo for 5 s."
  },
  "n3": {
   "x": 5180,
   "y": 14630,
   "w": 360,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "orange",
   "text": "Stitch ring draw is the app's one orchestrated moment: stitches fill in order over 600 ms, then the current stitch pulses (2 s loop, opacity 0.6 ↔ 1). Month tap: cell springs 1.0 → 1.06 → 1.0, breakdown cross-fades 180 ms, 'stitch' sound, selection haptic. Reduce motion: instant / 150 ms fades. Full table on the Motion board."
  },
  "n4": {
   "x": 4810,
   "y": 18710,
   "w": 440,
   "size": "m",
   "fill": "blue",
   "text": "Handoff notes (D8). Token changes: light text.muted #625E8F, light Kadam accent #5E6C0A. New strings added to §9.3: Remaining principal / বাকি মূল টাকা; Next installment / পরের কিস্তি; With your numbers / আপনার সংখ্যা দিয়ে; Rounded up to the next taka / পরের পূর্ণ টাকায় উপরে রাউন্ড; Cash in hand / হাতে পাবেন; Choose a month / মাস বেছে নিন; Banks you used before / আগে লেখা ব্যাংক; Version / সংস্করণ; delete-all confirmations (2 steps); 'You can change this later in Settings'. Icons here are Phosphor stand-ins; ship phosphor-react-native duotone. ৳ in the app icon must be outlined for export."
  }
 }
